ublic lors des visites guidées. La surface de la dalle, très peu exposée au soleil et soumise aux salissures constantes des oiseaux, devient trop souvent glissante et la dalle pourtant de forte épaisseur, mais légèrement fissurée, est devenue fuyarde au cours du temps. L'objet des travaux est de répondre à ces 2 inconvénients en mettant en place une étanchéité antidérapante sur cette dalle de béton armé."},{"code":"7","field_id":"TED-TD_DOCUMENT_TYPE","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"FR106","field_id":"TED-TENDERER_NUTS","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"TED-TITLE","lang":"FR","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Cathédrale Notre-Dame de Reims — Étanchéité de la terrasse entre les 2 tours occidentales"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"BG","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Фpaнция"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"CS","ordinal":1,"type":"text","value":"Francie"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"DA","ordinal":2,"type":"text","value":"Frankrig"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"DE","ordinal":3,"type":"text","value":"Frankreich"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"EL","ordinal":4,"type":"text","value":"Γαλλία"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"EN","ordinal":5,"type":"text","value":"France"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"ES","ordinal":6,"type":"text","value":"Francia"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"ET","ordinal":7,"type":"text","value":"Prantsusmaa"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"FI","ordinal":8,"type":"text","value":"Ranska"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"FR","ordinal":9,"type":"text","value":"France"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"GA","ordinal":10,"type":"text","value":"Fhrainc, an"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"HR","ordinal":11,"type":"text","value":"Francuska"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"HU","ordinal":12,"type":"text","value":"Franciaország"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"IT","ordinal":13,"type":"text","value":"Francia"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"LT","ordinal":14,"type":"text","value":"Prancūzija"},{"f